 ore at the Residence Life International Welcome Week Cookout from 500p-80
 0p in the Union Street Courtyard. Play outdoor games\, such as\, badminto
 n\, volleyball\, cornhole\, and more! Bring your friends\, meet new peopl
 e\, and enjoy an evening full of fun! We can't wait to see you there!\n\n
 Hosted by: \n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved
