DESCRIPTION:Looking for a place to volunteer and get your hands dirty this
  summer? La Casa is looking for help to plant\, care\, and harvest the ce
 nter's garden. No experience needed\, just enthusiasm! Interested? Want t
 o learn more? Email us at lacasa@iu.edu to learn more and sign-up. \n\nHo
 sted by: La Casa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nAdditional Information can be 
 found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12480651
