DESCRIPTION:Jumpstart Your Campus Life at the Student Involvement Fair!\nL
 ooking to meet new people\, explore your interests\, or try something tot
 ally new? The Fall Student Involvement Fair is your one-stop event to dis
 cover 400+ student organizations\, campus resources\, and local community
  partners—all in one vibrant\, high-energy space.\nWhether you're into le
 adership\, culture\, service\, the arts\, activism\, or just want to chec
 k out the activity and grab some tasty bites from local food trucks\, the
 re's something here for everyone. It’s your chance to explore what inspir
 es you\, find where you belong\, and take the lead in shaping your campus
  experience.\nTake the first step toward the finding the experiences\, fr
 iendships\, and leadership opportunities that will define your time as a 
 Hoosier.\n \nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and ed
 ucational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students
  and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Ind
 iana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Leadership Center\n\nAdditi
 onal Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12
 467058
